OL,3,GNEWSALast call for the mall? How
OL,4,Ashopping centres are reinventing
OL,5,Athemselves
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Brunel Centre was once a thriving
OL,8,Fretail destination, attracting shoppers
OL,9,Ffrom far and wide.
OL,11,F"It was incredible," says town
OL,12,Fcouncillor Keith Ely, who remembers its
OL,13,Fopening in Bletchley, Buckinghamshire,
OL,14,Fin 1973.
OL,16,FBack then, centre:MK, a large
OL,17,Fdestination shopping centre four miles
OL,18,Faway in Milton Keynes, did not exist,
OL,19,Fand the Brunel was quite the draw.
OL,21,FNow, like many other medium-sized
OL,22,Fshopping centres, it is struggling.
